# Metric

Purpose: the smallest unit of insight — one number answering one
question ("how many open deals?", "pipeline value?"). Exists because
every other widget makes you read; a metric is glanceable from across
the room. The atom of every overview row.

| Option | Category | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| size / position | layout | x,y,w,h (default 2x2) | RGL grid |
| variant | layout | auto / tile / bar | auto: w>=6,h=1 renders wide stat bar |
| title | display | text, default auto from agg+concept | |
| icon | display | icon name / none | |
| agg | data | count / sum / avg | |
| field | data | number field (sum/avg only) | |
| number format | display | plain / compact (1.2k) / currency / percent | |
| delta | display | off / vs prior 7d / 30d | secondary stat |
| sub-caption | display | on / off | renders condition summary |
| color thresholds | display | none / {green<=, red>=} | accent by value |
| concept | filter | conceptId / inherit | optional for per-concept context |
| conditions | filter | SidebarCondition[] | |
| match | filter | all / any | |
| archived | filter | exclude (default) / include | |
